          "systemMessage": "=You run the published agent skill below, exactly as written. You have no tools: every file the skill says to read is pasted after the skill. Return only the structured output.\n\n# Skill: buying-signal-scoring\n\n{{ $('Load buying-signal-scoring').first().json.skill }}\n\n# references/signal-weights.md\n\n{{ $('Load signal weights').first().json.skill }}\n\n# The ICP\n\n{{ $('Your settings').first().json.icp }}\n\n# The offer\n\n{{ $('Your settings').first().json.value_prop }}\n\n# The signals\n\nThe signals are the Sales Navigator columns of each lead row. A blank cell is unknown, never a signal. Today is {{ $now.toISODate() }}. All leads given were labelled In (fit tier 1).",
